  "published": "2026-10-23T15:53:02+00:00",
  "summary": "<p>Office of the Spokesman</p>\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-default-hero-container wp-block-default-hero-container--no-featured-content \">\n\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-default-hero module featured-content page-header \">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"row bc_row\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-content__copy\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"featured-content__headline stars-above\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUnited States Welcomes Paraguay as Newest Pax Silica Signatory\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-meta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- get document type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta doctype-meta\">Media Note</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__audience\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__location\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__publish-date\">October 23, 2026</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"page-header__actions\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today, the United States welcomed Paraguay as the 26th signatory to the Pax Silica Declaration. Foreign Minister Ramírez signed on behalf of Paraguay at a ceremony at the Department of State in Washington, D.C., alongside Under Secretary of State for Economic Affairs Jacob Helberg, commencing Paraguay’s participation in the initiative.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The United States and Paraguay affirmed their commitment to leveraging Paraguay&#8217;s critical minerals and hydropower to build super intelligence infrastructure in the Americas.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For media inquiries, please <a href=\"https://iipstate.my.site.com/DOSMediaInquiries/s/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"external-link\">submit questions here<span class=\"icon-external\" title=\"external link icon\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"external link icon\"></span></a>, and stay updated by following <a href=\"https://iipstate.my.site.com/DOSMediaInquiries/s/\">@UnderSecE</a> on X.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For more information, visit <a href=\"https://www.state.gov/pax-silica/\">Pax Silica</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>",
  "content": "<p>Office of the Spokesman</p>\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-default-hero-container wp-block-default-hero-container--no-featured-content \">\n\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-default-hero module featured-content page-header \">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"row bc_row\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-content__copy\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"featured-content__headline stars-above\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUnited States Welcomes Paraguay as Newest Pax Silica Signatory\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-meta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- get document type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta doctype-meta\">Media Note</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__audience\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__location\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__publish-date\">October 23, 2026</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"page-header__actions\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today, the United States welcomed Paraguay as the 26th signatory to the Pax Silica Declaration. Foreign Minister Ramírez signed on behalf of Paraguay at a ceremony at the Department of State in Washington, D.C., alongside Under Secretary of State for Economic Affairs Jacob Helberg, commencing Paraguay’s participation in the initiative.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The United States and Paraguay affirmed their commitment to leveraging Paraguay&#8217;s critical minerals and hydropower to build super intelligence infrastructure in the Americas.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For media inquiries, please <a href=\"https://iipstate.my.site.com/DOSMediaInquiries/s/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"external-link\">submit questions here<span class=\"icon-external\" title=\"external link icon\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"external link icon\"></span></a>, and stay updated by following <a href=\"https://iipstate.my.site.com/DOSMediaInquiries/s/\">@UnderSecE</a> on X.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For more information, visit <a href=\"https://www.state.gov/pax-silica/\">Pax Silica</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>",
